GoldenrodCity_Text_Woman2_1::
	.string "TUSCANY: I do believe that this is\n"
	.string "the first time we’ve met?\p"
	.string "Please allow me to introduce myself.\p"
	.string "I am TUSCANY of Tuesday.\p"
	.string "By way of introduction, please accept\n"
	.string "this gift, a SILK SCARF.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_Woman2_2::
	.string "TUSCANY: Wouldn’t you agree that it\n"
	.string "is most adorable?\p"
	.string "It strengthens normal-type moves.\p"
	.string "I am certain it will be of use.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_Woman2_3::
	.string "TUSCANY: Have you met MONICA, my\n"
	.string "older sister?\p"
	.string "Or my younger brother, WESLEY?\p"
	.string "I am the second of seven children.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_WorkerF_1::
	.string "Is that man in black dressed up\n"
	.string "like a TEAM ROCKET member? How\l"
	.string "silly!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_WorkerF_2::
	.string "Was that man in black really part\n"
	.string "of TEAM ROCKET? I can’t believe it!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "They built the new RADIO TOWER to\n"
	.string "replace the old, creaky one.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketM_1::
	.string "So this is the RADIO TOWER...$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketM_2::
	.string "What do you want, you pest? Scram!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketM2::
	.string "POKéMON? They’re nothing more than\n"
	.string "tools for making money!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_Boy_1::
	.string "I know there’s a new BIKE SHOP, but\n"
	.string "I can’t find it anywhere.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketM3::
	.string "Stay out of the way! Beat it!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketF::
	.string "Our dream will soon come true...\p"
	.string "It was such a long struggle...$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketF2::
	.string "Take over the RADIO TOWER...\p"
	.string "What? It’s none of your business!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_Woman22_1::
	.string "The RADIO TOWER in GOLDENROD CITY\n"
	.string "is a landmark.\p"
	.string "They’re running a promotional\n"
	.string "campaign right now.\p"
	.string "They are giving away the newest\n"
	.string "RADIO-VISIO!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_Woman22_2::
	.string "Oh! Is that?\n"
	.string "A RADIO-VISIO?\p"
	.string "It can tune the most popular\n"
	.string "TV show, the TEACHY TIME!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "Whew! This is one big town. I don’t\n"
	.string "know where anything is.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_CrushGirl::
	.string "The man at that house rates your\n"
	.string "POKéMON names.\p"
	.string "He can even rename your POKéMON.$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketM4::
	.string "Come taste the true terror of\n"
	.string "TEAM ROCKET!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_RocketF3::
	.string "Hey, brat! You don’t belong here!\n"
	.string "Get lost!$"

GoldenrodCity_Text_Youngster::
	.string "E-he-he-he...\p"
	.string "I got in trouble for playing in the\n"
	.string "basement of the DEPT.STORE.$"

